Ready? [Check your product's requirements](/tools/can-i-sell-this).$thickbodyA$, sections = '[{"heading": "What changed", "summary": "From on-request certificates to filing at entry."}, {"heading": "Who must file", "summary": "Importers of regulated finished products at every value."}, {"heading": "The PGA message set", "summary": "Data elements filed per entry line."}, {"heading": "Filing options", "summary": "Full filing, disclaimers, and Product Registry references."}, {"heading": "Deadlines", "summary": "8 July 2026; 8 January 2027 for FTZ withdrawals."}, {"heading": "Preparation checklist", "summary": "HTS mapping, data readiness, and ACE testing."}]'::jsonb, short_answer = 'Under the CPSC eFiling final rule of 8 January 2025, importers of consumer products subject to a CPSC rule, ban, standard or regulation must electronically file certificate data at entry via the PGA message set in ACE. Filing is mandatory for most imports from 8 July 2026, and for Foreign Trade Zone withdrawals from 8 January 2027.', updated_at = now() WHERE slug = 'cpsc-efiling-certificates-compliance';